      "nctId": "NCT06920043",
      "officialTitle": "A Phase 2, Randomized, Double-blinded, Placebo-controlled Study of Efimosfermin Alfa in Participants With Biopsy-confirmed Cirrhosis (Compensated) Due to Metabolic Dysfunction-associated Steatohepatitis (MASH)",
      "orgStudyIdInfo": {
